# Keeps the Fludd app out of the LANDING PAGE deployment.
#
# The root Vercel project has no build step, so it publishes every file in the
# repo as a static asset. Without this, app/package.json, app/src/**, and the
# migrations would all be fetchable at https://<landing-domain>/app/...
#
# The leading slash anchors the pattern to this directory. That matters: a bare
# `app/` would also match `src/app/` at any depth, and if Vercel ever resolved
# this file from the app project's root directory it would exclude the entire
# App Router from that deployment.
/app

# The app is deployed as a SEPARATE Vercel project with Root Directory = "app".
